OL,3,GNEWSAShania Twain to headline Blenheim
OL,4,APalace Festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FCountry music star Shania Twain has
OL,7,Fbeen announced as one of the headline
OL,8,Facts for next summer's Blenheim Palace
OL,9,FFestival.
OL,11,FThe five-time Grammy award winning
OL,12,Fsinger, best known for her hit Man! I
OL,13,FFeel Like a Woman!, will bring her 2027
OL,14,Fto the Unesco World Heritage site in
OL,15,FOxfordshire on 29 June 2027.
OL,17,FIt comes after the festival, held in
OL,18,Fthe grounds of the palace, announced
OL,19,FAlex Warren as its first headliner for
OL,20,Fnext year's run of shows last month.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
